Z||000000||DJRice||08-21-2000||09:07 PM||||I'm chasing a problem on my brothers 86 V6.  At first, I thought we just had a loose belt that was squealing, but after trying every belt tightening and quieting trick in the book I began to listen to the "sqeal" more closely and now Ive decided that it is the sound of air rushing through a hole somewhere.  I suspect that it is the EGR solenoid, because he gets the occasional code 32.  <P>Has anyone dealt with this problem before?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"||||reg||1
